# This directory holds TMI keys generated by scripts/tmi-keys-init.sh.
#
# GENERATED FILES (all gitignored — never commit):
#   tmi.pub.jwk     — plaintext public JWK (served at /.well-known/jwks.json)
#   tmi.priv.jwe    — PBES2-encrypted private JWK (encrypted at rest)
#   .pass           — random passphrase for decrypting tmi.priv.jwe (chmod 600)
#
# To generate keys:
#   npm run tmi:keys:init
#
# To start the server with decrypted key in tmpfs:
#   npm run tmi:start
